Package: BindableWidgets
Type: Package
Title: Two-Way Bindable UI Widgets and Reactive App State Management for Shiny
Version: 0.2.0
Author: Jay Warrick [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jay Warrick <jay.warrick@gmail.com>
Description: Provides two-way reactive-bound inputs (numericInput2, textInput2, 
    checkboxInput2, selectInput2, sliderInput2), an interactive tabular sequencer 
    (bindableTableInput) with row grouping, repeats, and drag-and-drop reordering, 
    and a unified parameter manager (bind_all_settings, save_settings, load_settings, 
    export_settings, import_settings, rvsToList, setWidgetState) for robust Shiny 
    application state monitoring, persistence, and reloading.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports:
    shiny (>= 1.7.0),
    htmltools (>= 0.5.0),
    data.table (>= 1.14.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8.0)
Suggests:
